WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:04.759
Big news Morgans is a former member of the
Roger Pirates.

00:00:04.759 --> 00:00:11.320
In other words a member of the most powerful
and influential pirate crew in history.

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:16.990
Someone who fought side be side with the likes
of Shanks, Rayleigh and Roger himself, reaching

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:19.570
the last island of the grand line.

00:00:19.570 --> 00:00:24.769
And just like Shanks, Crocus or Rayleigh,
he has worked hard behind the scenes to make

00:00:24.769 --> 00:00:30.789
Roger's last will come true and has helped
Luffy get to where he is today, using his

00:00:30.789 --> 00:00:36.050
influence on the world government and his
monopoly on information in the one piece world.

00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:41.540
This sounds of course absolutely preposterous
and I thought the exact same thing when I

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:45.390
first stumbled across the idea on my subreddit
wild anime theories.

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:51.440
However, as reddit user LedgeEndDairy points
out correctly, there is actually surprisingly

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:55.920
much evidence pointing in exactly that direction.

00:00:55.920 --> 00:01:02.280
And when you follow the breadcrumbs, it only
leaves us with one possible conclusion: Big

00:01:02.280 --> 00:01:05.580
News Morgan is very likely a Roger Pirate.

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:09.940
To be precise one of these men right here.

00:01:09.940 --> 00:01:11.670
I'll tell you why in a second.

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:13.670
Also if you haven't yet, make sure to subscribe.

00:01:13.670 --> 00:01:14.770
It's free.

00:01:14.770 --> 00:01:20.960
Big News Morgan is not just anyone, but one
of the most influential and powerful people

00:01:20.960 --> 00:01:22.130
in the world.

00:01:22.130 --> 00:01:26.630
And we really have no idea what he actually
looks like.

00:01:26.630 --> 00:01:32.060
After all, Oda-sensei has confirmed that Morgans
isn't some type of intelligent animal, like

00:01:32.060 --> 00:01:38.280
for example a member of the minks, but a human
that has eaten the bird bird zoan fruit model

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:39.510
albatross.

00:01:39.510 --> 00:01:45.080
In other words, similar to Chopper, Morgan
is constantly in his hybrid form.

00:01:45.080 --> 00:01:51.400
So he could be someone we have seen in the
story before without ever realising it.

00:01:51.400 --> 00:01:54.000
Here's what we know so far about Big News
Morgans:

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:57.350
He is the president of the World Economy News
Paper.

00:01:57.350 --> 00:02:02.260
In other words, he is the one who prints the
newspapers that are being distributed across

00:02:02.260 --> 00:02:06.869
the world by the infamous news coo, that's
the name of the birds that distribute the

00:02:06.869 --> 00:02:08.420
news across the one piece world.

00:02:08.420 --> 00:02:14.170
While Morgans and his team look very quirky,
you shouldn't let yourself be fooled.

00:02:14.170 --> 00:02:16.840
He is incredibly powerful.

00:02:16.840 --> 00:02:22.000
This world is fully controlled by a global
world government, that not only re-writes

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:28.500
history to fit its own purposes, but also
goes extremely hard against anyone trying

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:34.760
to share truths and news that could harm its
power - just ask the scholars of Ohara.

00:02:34.760 --> 00:02:39.440
Controlling Information and keeping the citizens
of the world badly informed has probably been

00:02:39.440 --> 00:02:44.110
the governments most powerful tool to stay
in power for the past 800 years.

00:02:44.110 --> 00:02:50.400
And yet, here we have this man, that runs
the worlds biggest newspaper.

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:56.599
That makes Morgan one of the most dangerous
and influential people on the planet.

00:02:56.599 --> 00:03:00.959
I'm really curious why the government has
allowed him to build such a monopoly.

00:03:00.959 --> 00:03:06.670
My guess would be that Morgan used to play
along nicely with the government and help

00:03:06.670 --> 00:03:08.200
them spread their propaganda.

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:13.379
We have already seen that the government tried
to bribe him and that they had an undercover

00:03:13.379 --> 00:03:15.170
agent at his office.

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:22.090
I think it is only quite recently that Morgans
has gone so openly against the Gorosei.

00:03:22.090 --> 00:03:27.070
Another reason however, is that Morgans is
one of the emperors of the underworld, where

00:03:27.070 --> 00:03:35.050
the government, countries and pirates all
trade weapons, information and anything else

00:03:35.050 --> 00:03:37.080
imaginable away from the public eye.

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:38.080
Morgans deals with information.

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:44.269
Not only does he have the power to shape global
opinions, but he can also blackmail others

00:03:44.269 --> 00:03:47.050
by sharing sensitive information.

00:03:47.050 --> 00:03:52.510
For many years, he was part of the system,
that helped the Yonko and the government alike

00:03:52.510 --> 00:03:54.599
in controlling the news.

00:03:54.599 --> 00:04:01.540
And even though his power is mostly information,
he is also physically quite strong, having

00:04:01.540 --> 00:04:06.910
no problem what so ever dealing with the Cypher
Pole agent that threatened him or standing

00:04:06.910 --> 00:04:11.319
side by side with some of the strongest people
in the story.

00:04:11.319 --> 00:04:17.680
He knew exactly that Stussy was an undercover
agent as well and what she was capable of,

00:04:17.680 --> 00:04:22.400
and yet he was not in the slightest intimidated
by her presence.

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:28.070
It was only with the end of Whole Cake Island
that Morgans started doing his own thing.

00:04:28.070 --> 00:04:33.860
He revealed his interest in the supernova
and started cheering for Luffy in particular

00:04:33.860 --> 00:04:36.280
to become the next pirate king.

00:04:36.280 --> 00:04:40.370
Now you could try to argue that all of these
things could simply be the characteristics

00:04:40.370 --> 00:04:45.510
of a cunning and tough journalist, who just
wants to get money and excitement out of it

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:46.510
for himself.

00:04:46.510 --> 00:04:49.400
However, this is where things get a little
fishy.

00:04:49.400 --> 00:04:54.960
First of all, what we mentioned earlier, it's
really strange that he never leaves his hybrid

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:55.960
form.

00:04:55.960 --> 00:04:59.020
This is clearly to protect his true identity.

00:04:59.020 --> 00:05:05.080
The only question is, who could Morgans be
that would be problematic for his job?

00:05:05.080 --> 00:05:10.520
It must be someone who would get him intro
trouble either with the government or cost

00:05:10.520 --> 00:05:13.490
him his credibility with his readers.

00:05:13.490 --> 00:05:17.590
This journalist, who has a secret identity,
should be familiar to you.

00:05:17.590 --> 00:05:19.560
It's basically the superman trope.

00:05:19.560 --> 00:05:25.740
Now I don't think that Morgans is the lurking
legend or anything, but I do think that this

00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:28.340
is Oda-sensei's take on it.

00:05:28.340 --> 00:05:33.290
And his fruit itself is also quite suspicious.

00:05:33.290 --> 00:05:35.960
Morgan is an Albatros devil fruit user.

00:05:35.960 --> 00:05:43.460
The Albatros is notorious for its long-distance
flight abilities, and yet Morgan here, can't

00:05:43.460 --> 00:05:44.460
fly.

00:05:44.460 --> 00:05:45.460
Allegedly.

00:05:45.460 --> 00:05:49.520
We also know for a fact, that Morgan was the
one who reported on Luffy's exploits on whole

00:05:49.520 --> 00:05:55.620
cake island and who declared him as the next
emperor before he made his way to Wano.

00:05:55.620 --> 00:06:01.150
In fact, we can assume that it was his newspaper
that has been distributing news about the

00:06:01.150 --> 00:06:04.070
straw hats exploits throughout the story.

00:06:04.070 --> 00:06:09.039
And as far as I remember, the straw hats have
always been portrayed in quite a positive

00:06:09.039 --> 00:06:14.610
light, presented as this powerful crew of
upcoming pirates, that bring turmoil to wherever

00:06:14.610 --> 00:06:15.610
they go.

00:06:15.610 --> 00:06:20.259
And while it's still unclear whether or not
Morgans has any influence on the bounties

00:06:20.259 --> 00:06:26.009
themselves, he seems to be the one to print
and distribute all bounty posters.

00:06:26.009 --> 00:06:33.130
He was clearly the one who put the photo of
Gear5 Luffy on his new wanted poster and has

00:06:33.130 --> 00:06:34.889
included the D in his name.

00:06:34.889 --> 00:07:23.210
Now all of that strongly hints at Big News
Morgan having a secret agenda 

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:43.050
and a secret identity.

00:07:43.050 --> 00:07:59.340
However, why do I say with such certainty
that he might be a Roger pirate in disguise?

00:07:59.340 --> 00:08:02.190
You better put your seatbelt on for this one.

00:08:02.190 --> 00:08:09.050
Let's begin with the matter of Roger finding
the one piece and becoming the pirate king.

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:14.470
Since it's the premise for the entire story,
I think none of us ever really questioned

00:08:14.470 --> 00:08:17.870
how Roger got so famous in the first place.

00:08:17.870 --> 00:08:21.360
Because when you think about it, that's quite
fishy too.

00:08:21.360 --> 00:08:26.789
Roger was the first person in 800 years to
reach the last island.

00:08:26.789 --> 00:08:32.459
There he found the one piece and named the
island Laugh Tale, based on Joy Boys story

00:08:32.459 --> 00:08:33.589
he read there.

00:08:33.589 --> 00:08:36.449
However, why would anyone believe him?

00:08:36.449 --> 00:08:43.449
Who confirmed that this actually happened
and that Roger didn't make it up?

00:08:43.449 --> 00:08:48.699
Someone had to actually tell the press that
this happened, because Roger clearly wasn't

00:08:48.699 --> 00:08:52.819
the one who told the world.

00:08:52.819 --> 00:09:00.279
He read his new epithet 'Pirate King' in the
news paper himself and found it amusing.

00:09:00.279 --> 00:09:05.670
The easiest explanation here, is that the
news about Roger were spread by someone who

00:09:05.670 --> 00:09:07.749
was there.

00:09:07.749 --> 00:09:12.809
A journalist, who accompanied Roger on his
trip, either because Roger was nice enough

00:09:12.809 --> 00:09:17.989
to let them or because Roger himself wanted
to make a name for himself.

00:09:17.989 --> 00:09:21.519
And I believe that this person was Morgan.

00:09:21.519 --> 00:09:27.209
The man who became famous for breaking the
story and naming Roger pirate king.

00:09:27.209 --> 00:09:33.259
This would explain Morgan's obsession with
Luffy und the race for the next pirate king

00:09:33.259 --> 00:09:34.779
perfectly as well.

00:09:34.779 --> 00:09:38.249
As you know, Roger was waiting for the return
of Joy Boy.

00:09:38.249 --> 00:09:45.620
And in anticipation of his death, he did everything
in his power to ease the way for his return.

00:09:45.620 --> 00:09:50.569
He fathered at least one child with ace, that
he hoped would become joy boy later.

00:09:50.569 --> 00:09:54.959
He then tasked his men with carrying on his
will and prepare joy boy's arrival.

00:09:54.959 --> 00:10:00.489
He sent out shanks to find the right person
and get his hands on the Nika Nika fruit.

00:10:00.489 --> 00:10:04.989
Shanks was to give that person the fruit and
entrust them with Roger's hat.

00:10:04.989 --> 00:10:09.589
He then stationed Crocus at the entrance to
the grand line to scout for the person with

00:10:09.589 --> 00:10:15.179
the straw hat, tell them about the final island
and teach them how to navigate the first half

00:10:15.179 --> 00:10:16.179
of the Grand Line.

00:10:16.179 --> 00:10:21.310
He then stationed his right hand man Rayleigh
at the halfway point on Sabaody.

00:10:21.310 --> 00:10:28.180
Rayleigh would also identify Joy Boy by his
hat, train him and help him cross over into

00:10:28.180 --> 00:10:30.569
the new world, the second part of the grand
line.

00:10:30.569 --> 00:10:35.949
And one possibility is that his third in command,
Scopper Gaban is waiting on Roadstar island

00:10:35.949 --> 00:10:39.949
to teach Joy Boy about Laugh Tale and the
final journey there.

00:10:39.949 --> 00:10:43.579
But that's a story for a different video.

00:10:43.579 --> 00:10:48.850
Because as you've figured out by now, Morgan
would fit this pattern perfectly.

00:10:48.850 --> 00:10:51.589
He has helped to spread Luffy's legend.

00:10:51.589 --> 00:10:57.000
He is the one who declared him an emperor
and who believes that he will be the next

00:10:57.000 --> 00:10:58.040
pirate king.

00:10:58.040 --> 00:11:04.860
Now we have heard many people believe in Luffy
finding the one piece, but Morgans is the

00:11:04.860 --> 00:11:10.529
only person, that has never met Luffy in person
and still believes it?

00:11:10.529 --> 00:11:14.579
Why, because he also recognised Roger's straw
hat.

00:11:14.579 --> 00:11:20.600
And so Morgan has made sure to favour Luffy
in public perception and ease his way.

00:11:20.600 --> 00:11:22.350
How so you may ask?

00:11:22.350 --> 00:11:26.889
Well remember how Rayleigh, Shanks and co
keep up with LUffy's development.

00:11:26.889 --> 00:11:32.930
We have seen Shanks more than once read about
Luffy in the news.

00:11:32.930 --> 00:11:36.819
It seems to be his trusted source of info
about him for some reason.

00:11:36.819 --> 00:11:42.129
I assume you would also expect Shanks to keep
eyes on Luffy some other way, but he seems

00:11:42.129 --> 00:11:45.999
suspiciously content with the regular newspaper.

00:11:45.999 --> 00:11:51.489
Well if Morgan was his former crew mate, part
of the same mission to help Joy Boy, then

00:11:51.489 --> 00:11:55.089
of course Shanks would trust that information.

00:11:55.089 --> 00:12:02.060
Morgan most likely would put it in there for
other members of the Roger crew to see.

00:12:02.060 --> 00:12:06.540
I also want you to think about the aftermath
of the war at Marineford.

00:12:06.540 --> 00:12:12.630
Luffy returns to marine HQ to literally send
a message to the rest of the crew, to train

00:12:12.630 --> 00:12:16.949
for 2 years and meet back at sabaody strong
enough to take on the new world.

00:12:16.949 --> 00:12:20.279
But that wasn't actually luffy's idea.

00:12:20.279 --> 00:12:23.170
Yup, you guessed it, it was Rayleigh's.

00:12:23.170 --> 00:12:28.509
Rayleigh proposed to Luffy to get a picture
taken at Marineford with the message on his

00:12:28.509 --> 00:12:30.499
arm visible to the cameras.

00:12:30.499 --> 00:12:33.739
And it was Rayleigh who accompanied him there.

00:12:33.739 --> 00:12:39.499
Yes, it was a real ballsy stunt of Luffy to
come back, but there was absolutely no guarantee

00:12:39.499 --> 00:12:45.730
that it would make the news or that they would
use that exact picture of Luffy with the message

00:12:45.730 --> 00:12:46.730
clearly visible.

00:12:46.730 --> 00:12:51.170
What if the government wanted to cover this
up as well, avoiding the humiliation of having

00:12:51.170 --> 00:12:55.040
Luffy back there and having him escape a second
time.

00:12:55.040 --> 00:13:00.899
If Morgan, the one curating the news, was
an ally of Rayleigh however, then of course

00:13:00.899 --> 00:13:04.549
he could ensure that the straw hats receive
Luffy's message.

00:13:04.549 --> 00:13:09.980
Rayleigh and Morgan staged the entire thing
as a massive media stunt.

00:13:09.980 --> 00:13:16.829
Luffy rings the bell, lays down flowers and
then takes of his hat to pay respect to those

00:13:16.829 --> 00:13:20.759
who have fallen, while the marines charge
in like idiots.

00:13:20.759 --> 00:13:27.559
The reporters there have no chance, but portray
luffy as the noble mysterious rookie, who

00:13:27.559 --> 00:13:29.879
has come with Jinbe and Silvers Rayleigh.

00:13:29.879 --> 00:13:35.040
And one of the reporters even literally says:
'This is big news!'

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:39.790
Morgan's catchphrase before we ever get to
meet him.

00:13:39.790 --> 00:13:44.100
And once again, we see the marines reacting
to this news breaking, saying that the article

00:13:44.100 --> 00:13:47.329
already has spread around the world.

00:13:47.329 --> 00:13:53.629
So once again, just like on whole cake island
and on wano news about Luffy gets out, that

00:13:53.629 --> 00:13:56.089
the government wanted to keep quiet.

00:13:56.089 --> 00:14:02.019
And Morgan being a Roger pirate also would
explain one of the biggest plot holes in the

00:14:02.019 --> 00:14:08.389
story: Why is Luffy's full name always displayed
on his wanted posters?

00:14:08.389 --> 00:14:13.720
We know that the Gorosei want to keep the
D initial a secret.

00:14:13.720 --> 00:14:16.889
INCLUDING for Luffy, as we learned after Wano.

00:14:16.889 --> 00:14:23.730
Yet Luffy has been wanted as Monkey D. Luffy
on every single bounty poster.

00:14:23.730 --> 00:14:30.199
The government wanted to hide the D initial
so hard, they even renamed Gol D Roger into

00:14:30.199 --> 00:14:31.329
Gold Roger.

00:14:31.329 --> 00:14:35.050
They also surely wanted to hide Luffy being
related to Garp.

00:14:35.050 --> 00:14:41.089
So, if the Government would have had its way,
I bet Luffy could have been just LUFFY on

00:14:41.089 --> 00:14:45.239
the bounty poster, like Shanks is just Shanks.

00:14:45.239 --> 00:14:50.989
If you have someone in the news 'accidentally'
publishing the D initial however, who operates

00:14:50.989 --> 00:14:57.790
on his own terms, and who wants the D clan
out in the open, that would explain a lot.

00:14:57.790 --> 00:15:03.110
Morgan is the missing piece linking Rayleigh
and Shanks and the other members of the Roger

00:15:03.110 --> 00:15:07.869
pirates that are working to make Luffy the
next pirate king.

00:15:07.869 --> 00:15:13.069
Oda hides his appearance, because we have
now met all of Rogers crew through Oden's

00:15:13.069 --> 00:15:14.069
flashback.

00:15:14.069 --> 00:15:17.049
And age wise it also fits pretty smoothly.

00:15:17.049 --> 00:15:21.449
He was in his early 20s during Roger's journey
to laugh tale.

00:15:21.449 --> 00:15:25.669
So who out of Rogers men could Morgans possibly
be?

00:15:25.669 --> 00:15:29.809
I have 4 candidate for you: First is this
guy here, Petermoo.

00:15:29.809 --> 00:15:35.799
He has a very similar body shape to Morgans
and is also earring a feathered hat.

00:15:35.799 --> 00:15:41.609
Then there is Momora, who also wears a hat,
that is strangely shaped like a bird's head.

00:15:41.609 --> 00:15:46.749
There is Moon Isaac Jr, who has this beak
shaped nose and who might be based on Issac

00:15:46.749 --> 00:15:50.889
Newton, who discovered gravity, opposed to
flight.

00:15:50.889 --> 00:15:56.999
And finally there is Spencer, who I just threw
in there, because he looks pretty much like

00:15:56.999 --> 00:16:01.329
a male version of Nami and I wanted to mention
that.

00:16:01.329 --> 00:16:06.259
One idea I have seen thrown around is that
Morgan might have been the thing inside the

00:16:06.259 --> 00:16:13.050
giant egg, that was on board of the Roger
pirates ship, however that is a whole different

00:16:13.050 --> 00:16:14.569
beast.

00:16:14.569 --> 00:16:20.910
And if you want to know what it is, you really
can't miss out on this video right here.

